<p>The <strong class="selflink">epilogue_text_positions 2da</strong> 2da defines the location of the text boxes for images used in slide show dialogues.
</p><p>This <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> is defined as an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> in the<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da"> M2DA_base 2da</a> and has an <b>ID</b> of <b>1007</b>. It can be extended by m2da fragments which have names starting with <b>epilogue_text_positions</b>.
</p>
